  "instructions": [
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine the grated potatoes, rendered lardons, onion, garlic, paprika, salt, and black pepper. Mix well to combine.",
    "Gradually add the all-purpose flour and baking powder (if using) to the potato mixture, stirring to combine.",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Once the oil reaches 375°F (190°C), carefully drop the potato mixture by tablespoonfuls into the oil.",
    "Fry the fritters for 3-4 minutes on each side, or until they are golden brown and crispy. Repeat with any remaining potato mixture, adjusting the heat as needed to prevent burning."
